<title>GERMANY: German March wholesale sales down real 3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German March wholesale sales down real 3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	 March 97</p>
<p>Yr-on-yr change</p>
<p> Real				 -3 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			    -2 pct</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	 March 97    Feb 97   March 96</p>
<p>Mth/mth change (pct)</p>
<p> Real				 -2.1 pct    -0.2     +0.8</p>
<p> Nominal			    -1.6 pct    -0.6     +1.4</p>
<p>NOTE- Month-on-month changes are seasonally and calendar adjusted.</p>
<p>The statistics office provided the following breakdown of the March data by product group (Pct changes are year-on-year).</p>
<p>RAW MATERIALS, SEMIFINISHED</p>
<p>PRODUCTS, SCRAP MATERIALS</p>
<p> Real				  +2 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			     +4 pct</p>
<p>FOOD, BEVERAGES, TOBACCO</p>
<p> Real				  -8 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			     -6 pct</p>
<p>CONSUMER DURABLES, NON-DURABLES</p>
<p> Real				  -8 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			     -8 pct</p>
<p>MACHINERY, CAPITAL EQUIPMENT</p>
<p> Real				  -7 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			     -8 pct</p>
<p>OTHER PRODUCTS</p>
<p> Real				  +2 pct</p>
<p> Nominal			     +4 pct</p>
<p>AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTS,</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK</p>
<p> Real				  UNCH</p>
<p> Nominal			     +3 pct</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
